星穹铁道—风堇 (Honkai: Star Rail — Hyacine) MMD model
------------------------------------------------------

Model copyright: miHoYo. MMD edit: 流云景.

From round 11, Levi's body, joints, hands, feet and head reuse geometry (and
data derived from it, such as skin weights and expression morphs) from this
model. The derived data lives in assets/hyacine/ and in the code that reads it;
every .blend or .pmx built from this repository contains it.

